From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rosen Penev <rosenp@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:15:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] 88W8964: report the status of probe responses right
 away

The firmware reports no ACK status for management frames and can hold
on to probe responses for minutes, so hostapd waited that long for the
status of probe responses that request one. Report their status from a
copy right away, like for (re)association responses.

Signed-off-by: Rosen Penev <rosenp@gmail.com>
[Robert Peerenboom: split out of neheb/mwlwifi (upstream branch) commit
 92b4dd1 ("88W8964: return all TX frames to mac80211 and fix TX path
 bugs") and backported to db97edf2 on top of the OpenWrt patches]
Signed-off-by: Robert Peerenboom <development@mindrush.de>
---
 hif/pcie/8964/tx_ndp.c | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/hif/pcie/8964/tx_ndp.c
+++ b/hif/pcie/8964/tx_ndp.c
@@ -605,8 +605,14 @@ void pcie_tx_xmit_ndp(struct ieee80211_h
 			}
 		}
 
+		/* The firmware reports no ACK status, and can hold on to
+		 * probe responses for minutes, so report the status of a
+		 * copy right away.
+		 */
 		if (ieee80211_is_assoc_resp(wh->frame_control) ||
-		    ieee80211_is_reassoc_resp(wh->frame_control)) {
+		    ieee80211_is_reassoc_resp(wh->frame_control) ||
+		    (ieee80211_is_probe_resp(wh->frame_control) &&
+		     (tx_info->flags & IEEE80211_TX_CTL_REQ_TX_STATUS))) {
 			struct sk_buff *ack_skb;
 			struct ieee80211_tx_info *ack_info;
 
